cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SimpleDeHaze: a reproducible .NET testbed for classical non-learning single-image dehazing"
message: "If you use this software or its benchmark results, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sitnikov
    given-names: Maksim
repository-code: "https://github.com/yellow444/SimpleDehaze"
abstract: >-
  SimpleDeHaze is a .NET/Emgu.CV testbed for classical, non-learning single-image dehazing.
  It provides a common method interface, a canonical Dark Channel Prior baseline, interchangeable
  transmission refiners, CPU and CUDA paths, a headless benchmark with primary (non-aligned)
  full-reference metrics, and numerical consistency tests for the physical claims made in the
  documentation. Novelty statements for individual methods are tracked in NOVELTY.md.
keywords:
  - image dehazing
  - dark channel prior
  - atmospheric scattering model
  - reproducible research
  - .NET
  - Emgu.CV
license: MIT
